<title>SPAIN: Repsol 9-mth operating results by division.</title>
<headline>Repsol 9-mth operating results by division.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol operating results by division for the nine months to end-September, in billions of pesetas unless stated.</p>
<p> Exploration and production	 20.92   up  27   pct</p>
<p> Refining and marketing	     56.27   up   3.7 pct</p>
<p> Chemicals				18.88   vs  57.94</p>
<p> Gas					47.65   vs  42.20</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
